=== memhog ===
DESCRIPTION ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Policies: preferred-many local interleave membind preferred default


USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  memhog [-fFILE] [-rNUM] [-H] size[kmg] [policy [nodeset]]


POSITIONALS (3) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  size
  policy
             values: preferred-many, local, interleave, membind, preferred,
             default
  nodeset


FLAGS (3) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-f FILE  mmap is backed by FILE
-r NUM   repeat memset NUM times
-H       disable transparent hugepages
